('allied','Allied health & clinical technology','health',['51.08','51.09','51.10','51.18'],[4,4,1,4,1,3],'Use practical skills and technology to support patient care.',['Anatomy','Clinical science','Equipment or laboratory methods','Supervised practice'],'Compare two program open days or talk to students in different clinical programs.','Choose a specific approved program before comparing credentials and costs.','Certificate, associate or bachelor’s; occupation-specific','Imaging, laboratory science and other clinical programs qualify people for different work. They share an exploration area, not one qualifying degree.'),
('movement','Movement, nutrition & rehabilitation','health',['31.05','30.19','51.31','51.23'],[4,4,1,5,1,2],'Explore how people move, recover and stay well.',['Human biology','Movement science','Nutrition','Research methods'],'Observe a movement science class or compare exercise science and nutrition curricula.','Compare undergraduate programs and the prerequisites for later clinical study.','Undergraduate foundations; clinical professions may need graduate study','Physical therapy, occupational therapy and credentialed dietetics have distinct education and licensing requirements. Check the exact program.'),
