('social','Social work & community support','people',['44.07','44.00','44.02'],[1,3,1,5,3,2],'Work with people and communities to improve everyday life.',['Social policy','Human behavior','Community practice','Field placement'],'Volunteer with a community organization and reflect on the kind of work you enjoy.','Compare social work and human services degrees and field placements.','Associate or bachelor’s by program; clinical work needs more preparation','Clinical social work requires graduate education, supervised experience and licensing. Verify each program’s eligibility.'),
