('management','Business, operations & organizations','business',['52.01','52.02','52.10','52.11','52.13'],[2,3,1,3,5,4],'Help teams, services and organizations work better.',['Business foundations','Operations','Economics','Quantitative methods'],'Organize a small project and reflect on planning, teamwork and problem-solving.','Compare management, operations, supply chain and related business majors.','Associate or bachelor’s options; management roles often need experience','Manager occupations in the source links are often later-career destinations, not immediate graduate jobs.'),
